Academics Campus Experience Culture Impact Research Story type Feature Notice Story Video Apply filters Clear filters Video results for Sort by relevance Sort by date People results for People Results See more VT News Results See more Virginia Tech Jobs / Moving and Relocation Resources / Blacksburg and New River Valley / Explore Search all Virginia Tech jobs Employees only: Internal postings Committed to Our Veterans and Military Dual Career Program Employment Process Frequently Asked Questions Moving and Relocation Resources Current page: Blacksburg and New River Valley Greater Washington, D.C., area Roanoke Student Employment at Virginia Tech Virginia Tech Human Resources Blacksburg and New River Valley The New River Valley (NRV) is made up of 15 unique small-town communities that lie within four counties (Floyd, Giles, Montgomery, and Pulaski) and one city (Radford) in Southwest Virginia. The Town of Blacksburg is nestled on a plateau between the Blue Ridge and Allegheny mountains and houses Virginia Tech's main campus. The area boasts a plethora of unique and chain restaurants and stores, symphonies, theatres, historical attractions, sporting events, outdoor recreation activities, and a temperate climate. Relocation Resources The links found on this page are a small sampling of online resources that were curated to help with the process of moving to the area. It is important to note that this is not a comprehensive list, and we do not endorse non-Virginia Tech affiliates. Chamber and Community Websites Floyd County Chamber of Commerce Giles Chamber of Commerce Montgomery County Chamber of Commerce Pulaski County Chamber of Commerce Onward New River Valley Radford Chamber of Commerce Childcare Providers Visit the university's caregiving resources website . County/Town Websites Blacksburg Christiansburg Floyd County Giles County Montgomery County Pulaski County Radford Medical Carilion Clinic HCA VA (Locally known as LewisGale) VA Salem Healthcare System Off Campus Housing Resources Virginia Tech Resources Virginia Tech Off-Campus Housing Page Local Resources Affordable Corporate Suites CMG Leasing Dutch West Property Management Hethwood Apartments NRV Property Management Pointe West Management Raines Property Management Ridgewood Village Apartments River Mountain Properties Sabbatical Homes The Adams at Peppers Ferry The Highlands at Huckleberry Ridge Townside Property Management Other Resources Airbnb Facebook Group - HOMES 4 SALE OR RENT IN THE NRV Facebook Group - NRV HOMES 4 Rent-Sale-RTO Oaktree Townhomes - privately owned, can be found using property management companies or rental searches Realtor.com Vrbo Zillow Realtors New River Valley Association of Realtors Schools Floyd County Public Schools Giles County Public Schools Montgomery County Private Schools Montgomery County Public Schools Pulaski County Public Schools Radford City Schools Social/Civic Blacksburg Merchants Association Calendar of Events Blacksburg Newcomers Club Blacksburg Young Professionals Meet up Next Three Days Step Into Blacksburg Up on the Roof Transportation Amtrak Blacksburg Transit (BT Bus) Roanoke - Blacksburg Regional Airport The Smart Way Bus - A commuter bus service that links the Roanoke Valley to the New River Valley Virginia Tech Campus Parking Division of Human Resources Talent Acquisition Team North End Center, Suite 2300 300 Turner Street NW Blacksburg, VA 24061 Hours Monday - Friday, 8 a.m.-5 p.m. Phone 540-231-9331 Fax 540-231-3830 Email recruiting@vt.edu Follow Us Facebook | X Get Directions See All Locations Contact Virginia Tech University Status Principles of Community Privacy Statement Acceptable Use We Remember University Libraries Accessibility Consumer Information Cost & Aid SAFE at VT Policies Equal Opportunity WVTF University Bookstore Jobs at Virginia Tech © 2026 Virginia Polytechnic Institute and State University. All rights reserved. Instagram Facebook Linked-In Threads Youtube X Blue Sky"
