rs Coordinator Blacksburg Virginia Dean - Architecture Join the College of Architecture, Arts, and Design's undergraduate academic affairs and advising team and contribute to the delivery of a positive student experience. Help us build a better future! Tenure-Track Faculty Position in Computer Science Blacksburg Virginia Computer Science Computer science is changing faster than ever, and today’s questions will shape the field for decades to come. Virginia Tech’s Department of Computer Science is seeking the next generation of faculty to help define what’s next. Apply today! Postdoctoral Associate Alexandria Virginia Housing Research Center Launch the next chapter of your research career with the Virginia Housing Research Center. As a Postdoctoral Associate, you'll work alongside leading researchers to explore housing innovation, inform policy decisions, and create positive impacts for communities throughout Virginia. Candidate Details “This website uses cookies to improve your experience. We use cookies to personalize job recommendations, understand site traffic, and enhance your interaction with our career site. By clicking ‘I Accept’, you consent to our use of cookies. By clicking ‘I Do Not Accept’, only essential cookies will be used, but certain features may not function as intended. You can change your cookie settings at any time by clicking ‘Manage Cookies’. For more information, please review our Privacy Policy.” Manage Consent Preferences Strictly Necessary Cookies Performance Cookies Manage Cookies I do not accept I accept Save Get Directions See All Locations Contact Virginia Tech University Status Principles of Community Privacy Statement Acceptable Use We Remember University Libraries Accessibility Consumer Information Cost & Aid SAFE at VT Policies Equal Opportunity WVTF University Bookstore Jobs at Virginia Tech © 2026 Virginia Tech. All rights reserved. Facebook X Threads Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Please choose a senior management"
