Extension Master Gardener Communications and Program Assistant for the statewide Extension Master Gardener (EMG) Program. \n\nThe VCE Master Gardener Program connects trained volunteers with local communities to deliver research-based horticultural education and outreach across the Commonwealth. In this role, you will provide critical administrative, communications, and operational support to the State EMG Office, helping to amplify our community impact and ensure smooth statewide operations. Candidate Details “This website uses cookies to improve your experience. We use cookies to personalize job recommendations, understand site traffic, and enhance your interaction with our career site. By clicking ‘I Accept’, you consent to our use of cookies. By clicking ‘I Do Not Accept’, only essential cookies will be used, but certain features may not function as intended. You can change your cookie settings at any time by clicking ‘Manage Cookies’. For more information, please review our Privacy Policy.” Manage Consent Preferences Strictly Necessary Cookies Performance Cookies Manage Cookies I do not accept I accept Save Get Directions See All Locations Contact Virginia Tech University Status Principles of Community Privacy Statement Acceptable Use We Remember University Libraries Accessibility Consumer Information Cost & Aid SAFE at VT Policies Equal Opportunity WVTF University Bookstore Jobs at Virginia Tech © 2026 Virginia Tech. All rights reserved. Facebook X Threads Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Please choose a senior management"
